From 7b25c086bdcaf922754aa0e2af8cf7500d7c3e9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Meshack Isava <carson-jpg@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 05:40:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(student): sidebar portal shell, dashboard redesign, fix
 referral 404

- Give the student portal its own persistent sidebar layout (desktop
  fixed sidebar, mobile off-canvas drawer) instead of the public
  Navbar/Footer. SiteShell now excludes /student like it already does
  for /admin and /auth.
- Rebuild StudentDashboard with a gradient hero, animated stat cards,
  progress bars, badges, empty states, and anchor-linked sections
  (Overview / My Course / Payments / Certificates / Referrals / Quiz
  Performance) that the sidebar nav jumps to.
- Share the loaded student's name/initials with the sidebar via a
  small context instead of a second fetch.
- Fix GET /api/students/[studentId]/referral-code 404: the route
  force-uppercased the id, but it's called with the student's own
  already-correctly-cased id (e.g. local-dev seed id "student-1"),
  so uppercasing it to "STUDENT-1" broke the lookup. Now looks up by
  the id as given, with a case-insensitive fallback for the few
  call sites that pass user-typed input.

No changes to production SSO path or NODE_ENV-gated local-dev bypass.
